Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Construct feasible multi-party exchanges using exact quantity, reservation, and transport services. Account for dependent legs, storage windows, and adaptation costs, and preserve unallocated surplus and unmet needs explicitly.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
